    "placesVisited": ["Sinhagad Fort", "Lavasa", "Lonavala", "Khandala", "Pune City Centre"],
    "story": "We set off early on a Saturday morning with the monsoon clouds already gathering over the hills. The drive through the Ghats was breathtaking — every hairpin bend revealed a new curtain of green.\n\nWe stopped at Sinhagad Fort just as the morning mist was lifting, and the view across the valley was worth every step of the climb. A local family shared their packed breakfast with us at the summit, and we sat there for longer than we planned, watching the clouds move through the valleys below.\n\nThe rest of the day was a blur of roadside vada pav, spontaneous detours, and the kind of conversations you only have when you're far from home. By the time we rolled back into the city, sunburned and grinning, we were already planning the next one."
  },
